~ start
sleep: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], I am Sleep.
sleep: Explore your dreams. One of them holds the key to [[WAKING|AWAKENING|ESCAPING]].
sleep: Choose wisely. Or don't. I'm a dream, not [[a COP|the police|your mom]].
- Eepy sleepy
	sleep: You sleep.
	sleep: The dream [[swallows|eats|absorbs]] you whole.
- Nuh uh
	sleep: You did a [[kickflip|360|barrel roll]].
	sleep: (Your stuck in your dream forever)
- What key?
	sleep: [[The one that|A|The]] key.
	sleep: Don't [[overthink|question|worry about]] it.
- Who are you?
	sleep: I'm a metaphor. I'm the ID of sleep.
=> END